      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Is the demo up, and do the four languages behave the same?\nAll of them get the same load from their worker and fail in the same proportion (≈ 10% at the api, on purpose). If one language stands out, there is something to investigate. Terms: see [0. Start here](/d/demo-otel-start).",
